// `isolate` is not built yet: it stops at the seam `concurrency.isolate` before its body
// runs. Expected: "before" is printed; "inside" and "after" are not, because
// a seam stops the program where it is reached (AGENTS.md section 1).
fn main() {
    print("before");
    isolate { print("inside"); }
    print("after");
}
